        "_brand_page": {
          "version": 3,
          "body": "<style>\n:root {--bg-color: #F4F6F8;--card-bg: #FFFFFF;--text-primary: #2C3E50;--text-secondary: #64829B;--accent: #00BCD4;--border-color: #E1E8ED;--font-size-large: 2.5rem;--font-size-base: 1rem}\n* {box-sizing: border-box;margin: 0;padding: 0}\nbody {font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;background-color: var(--bg-color);color: var(--text-primary);line-height: 1.6;font-size: 16px}\n\n/* Navigation */\n.nav-bar {background: var(--card-bg);border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);padding: 1rem 2rem;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center}\n.breadcrumb {font-size: 0.9rem;color: var(--text-secondary)}\n.breadcrumb a {color: var(--text-secondary);text-decoration: none;margin-right: 0.5rem}\n.breadcrumb a:hover {color: var(--accent)}\n.nav-menu {display: flex;gap: 1.5rem}\n.nav-menu a {color: var(--text-primary);text-decoration: none;font-size: 0.95rem}\n.nav-menu a:hover {color: var(--accent)}\n\n/* Hero Section */\n.hero {display: flex;flex-direction: row;align-items: stretch;min-height: 60vh;padding: 0 2rem;background: var(--bg-color)}\n.hero-text {flex: 3;padding: 4rem 2rem 4rem 0;display: flex;flex-direction: column;justify-content: center}\n.hero-text h1 {font-size: var(--font-size-large);margin-bottom: 1.5rem;color: var(--text-primary);font-weight: 600}\n.hero-text p {color: var(--text-secondary);max-width: 600px;margin-bottom: 1rem}\n.hero-info-panel {flex: 1;background: var(--text-primary);color: var(--card-bg);padding: 3rem 2rem;margin: 2rem 0;border-radius: 8px;display: flex;flex-direction: column;justify-content: center}\n.hero-info-panel h2 {color: var(--accent);font-size: 1.1rem;margin-bottom: 1rem;text-transform: uppercase;letter-spacing: 1px}\n.hero-info-panel .info-item {border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);padding: 1rem 0}\n.hero-info-panel .info-item:last-child {border-bottom: none}\n\n/* Content Sections */\n.section {padding: 4rem 2rem;max-width: 1200px;margin: 0 auto}\n.section h2 {font-size: 1.8rem;margin-bottom: 2rem;text-align: left;border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);padding-bottom: 0.5rem}\n\n/* FAQ Q&A Tone */\n.q-intro {background: var(--card-bg);padding: 2rem;margin-bottom: 3rem;border-left: 4px solid var(--accent)}\n\n/* Plans Vertical List */\n.plans-container {display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 2rem}\n.plan-card {background: var(--card-bg);padding: 2rem;position: relative;border-radius: 8px;overflow: hidden;box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);border: 1px solid var(--border-color);display: flex;flex-direction: column}\n.plan-number {font-size: 6rem;color: rgba(0, 188, 212, 0.1);position: absolute;bottom: -20px;right: 10px;font-weight: bold;pointer-events: none;z-index: 0}\n.plan-content {position: relative;z-index: 1}\n.plan-header {display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: flex-start;margin-bottom: 1.5rem;flex-wrap: wrap}\n.plan-title {font-size: 1.5rem;font-weight: 600}\n.plan-price {font-size: 1.8rem;color: var(--accent);font-weight: 600}\n.plan-annual {font-size: 0.9rem;color: var(--text-secondary);display: block;margin-top: 0.25rem}\n.plan-features {list-style: none;width: 100%}\n.plan-features li {padding: 0.5rem 0;border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);color: var(--text-secondary)}\n.plan-features li:last-child {border-bottom: none}\n.plan-badge {background: var(--accent);color: white;padding: 0.2rem 0.8rem;border-radius: 4px;font-size: 0.8rem;margin-left: 1rem;vertical-align: middle}\n\n/* FAQ Numbered List */\n.faq-list {list-style: none;counter-reset: faq-counter}\n.faq-item {background: var(--card-bg);padding: 1.5rem 2rem;margin-bottom: 1rem;border-radius: 6px;counter-increment: faq-counter;position: relative;padding-left: 4rem}\n.faq-item::before {content: counter(faq-counter);position: absolute;left: 1.5rem;top: 1.5rem;font-size: 1.5rem;font-weight: bold;color: var(--accent)}\n.faq-item h3 {font-size: 1.1rem;margin-bottom: 0.5rem}\n.faq-item p {color: var(--text-secondary);font-size: 0.95rem}\n\n/* Clients Section */\n.clients-grid {display: grid;grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));gap: 1.5rem}\n.client-card {background: var(--card-bg);padding: 1.5rem;border-radius: 8px;border: 1px solid var(--border-color)}\n.client-card h3 {font-size: 1.1rem;margin-bottom: 0.5rem;color: var(--text-primary)}\n.client-card p {font-size: 0.9rem;color: var(--text-secondary)}\n.client-link {display: inline-block;margin-top: 1rem;color: var(--accent);text-decoration: none;font-size: 0.9rem}\n\n/* Footer */\nfooter {background: var(--text-primary);color: var(--text-secondary);padding: 2rem;text-align: center;margin-top: 4rem;font-size: 0.9rem}\n\n/* Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 768px) {.hero { flex-direction: column;padding: 1rem;}\n    .hero-text { padding: 2rem 0;}\n    .hero-info-panel { margin: 0;padding: 2rem 1rem;}\n    .nav-menu { display: none;}\n    .plan-header { flex-direction: column;}\n    .section { padding: 2rem 1rem;}}\n</style><header class=\"nav-bar\">\n    <div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n        <a href=\"#home\">首页</a> / <span>服务详情</span>\n    </div>\n    <nav class=\"nav-menu\">\n        <a href=\"#features\">服务特性</a>\n        <a href=\"#plans\">订阅方案</a>\n        <a href=\"#clients\">客户端支持</a>\n        <a href=\"#faq\">常见问题</a>\n    </nav>\n</header>\n\n<main>\n    <section class=\"hero\" id=\"home\">\n        <div class=\"hero-text\">\n            <h1>EFCloud</h1>\n            <p>怎样才算可靠的网络加速服务？EFCloud 认为答案藏在底层架构与日常维护细节里。我们不宣扬“极致”或“秒连”，而是通过合理的线路分流与负载均衡，让每一次连接都符合预期。</p>\n            <p>面向个人流媒体用户、游戏玩家及小型团队，提供从基础线路到 IPLC 专线的多层次选择。</p>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"hero-info-panel\">\n            <h2>服务概览</h2>\n            <div class=\"info-item\">\n                <p>核心策略</p>\n                <p>多入口分流与智能调度</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"info-item\">\n                <p>服务对象</p>\n                <p>个人、极客、开发团队</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"info-item\">\n                <p>网络特性</p>\n                <p>IPLC 专线接入优化</p>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"features\">\n        <div class=\"q-intro\">\n            <h2>为什么需要分层架构？</h2>\n            <p>不同用户对网络的需求完全不同。浏览网页需要稳定性，流媒体需要带宽，游戏需要低延迟。EFCloud 将节点按任务类型分类调度，避免“一锅炖”式的资源争抢。</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"plans\">\n        <h2>订阅方案</h2>\n        <p>不知道选哪个？从您的日常使用场景出发。仅看视频选基础版，追求低延迟选旗舰版，多人共用选团队版。</p>\n        <div class=\"plans-container\">\n            <article class=\"plan-card\">\n                <div class=\"plan-number\">01</div>\n                <div class=\"plan-content\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"plan-title\">基础版</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"plan-price\">¥15</span><span>/月</span>\n                            <span class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                        <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n                        <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n                        <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n                        <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"plan-card\">\n                <div class=\"plan-number\">02</div>\n                <div class=\"plan-content\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"plan-title\">旗舰版</span>\n                            <span class=\"plan-badge\">推荐</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"plan-price\">¥35</span><span>/月</span>\n                            <span class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                        <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n                        <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n                        <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n                        <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n                        <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n            <article class=\"plan-card\">\n                <div class=\"plan-number\">03</div>\n                <div class=\"plan-content\">\n                    <div class=\"plan-header\">\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"plan-title\">团队版</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"plan-price\">¥85</span><span>/月</span>\n                            <span class=\"plan-annual\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n                        <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n                        <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n                        <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n                        <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n                        <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"clients\">\n        <h2>客户端支持</h2>\n        <p>EFCloud 服务兼容主流协议，无需专有客户端。以下是推荐使用的通用软件，请根据系统选择对应版本。</p>\n        <div class=\"clients-grid\">\n            <div class=\"client-card\">\n                <h3>Windows 平台</h3>\n                <p>推荐使用 v2rayN 或 Clash for Windows。支持系统代理与 TUN 模式，满足不同应用场景的分流需求。</p>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"client-link\">查看配置教程</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"client-card\">\n                <h3>macOS 平台</h3>\n                <p>推荐使用 ClashX Pro 或 Quantumult。支持根据 WI-FI 状态自动切换节点策略。</p>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"client-link\">查看配置教程</a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"client-card\">\n                <h3>移动端 (iOS/Android)</h3>\n                <p>iOS 推荐使用 Shadowrocket，Android 推荐 Clash for Android。均支持订阅链接一键导入。</p>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"client-link\">查看配置教程</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n        <h2>常见问题</h2>\n        <ol class=\"faq-list\">\n            <li class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h3>套餐流量用完后会怎样？</h3>\n                <p>流量耗尽后连接将被暂停，直到下一个计费周期自动恢复。您也可以选择升级套餐或购买额外的流量包补充。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h3>“极速流量”是什么意思？是否有速度限制？</h3>\n                <p>各套餐在未超出月度流量额度前，速度不设人工上限，具体取决于当地物理线路质量。超出极速流量额度后，可能会根据当时服务器负载进行一定限速。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h3>团队版支持哪些企业定制功能？</h3>\n                <p>团队版支持配置专属落地 IP、自定义域名分流规则以及独立的管理子账号。如需私有化部署，可联系客户经理评估方案。</p>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"faq-item\">\n                <h3>如果线路出现故障怎么处理？</h3>\n                <p>我们的系统会自动检测节点状态并切换。如遇大面积网络波动，请查看公告板或直接提交工单。旗舰版及以上用户享受优先响应服务。</p>\n            </li>\n        </ol>\n    </section>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n    <p>© 2023 EFCloud. 致力于提供理性的网络加速方案。</p>\n</footer>",
